[{"title":"晓庵山水小幅","author":"贝琼","text":"高堂见林壑，忽似过雷峰。\n窈窕一门险，峥嵘千嶂重。\n人声何处荅，虎迹有时逢。\n怒瀑流清耳，曾云起荡胸。\n松枯寒落子，草碧暖勾茸。\n势出丹青假，神疑造化钟。\n沧洲非世外，玄圃亦王封。\n绝境须吾赏，他年策瘦筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34684,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"贝琼","text":"水通银汉远，山对赤城高。\n一曲琼台路，春来尽碧桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34685,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈文举四首 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"凤皇台下犹为客，雪满头颅一病翁。\n却忆山人读书处，月轮夜照水晶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34686,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈文举四首 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"秀州西去湖州近，几处楼台罨画閒。\n借我钓鱼舟一叶，坐看七十二青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34687,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈文举四首 其三","author":"贝琼","text":"金刀火齐元非物，但取乾坤与坎离。\n采药芙蕖凌弱水，三山何路觅安期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34688,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈文举四首 其四","author":"贝琼","text":"当年我欲医君癖，今日君应笑我狂。\n一曲云林天定许，野猿山鸟未能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34689,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后偶书","author":"贝琼","text":"海门雷电夜随龙，江黑风高雪浪舂。\n今日看山双眼碧，插天金翠万芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈进善见过","author":"贝琼","text":"南风绿树午阴圆，好客联镳过海边。\n可惜红颜成白发，风流却话十年前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"贝琼","text":"高僧已送鹅翎白，好客仍分鹤顶红。\n秋日两株开烂熳，晚花原不嫁东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别候春燕","author":"贝琼","text":"莲子有心元自苦，杨花无蒂若为生。\n锦机织字难成匹，玉局弹棋恨不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胜南洲红梅","author":"贝琼","text":"龙门狂僧老万回，燕支常染玉堂梅。\n木杯何日过东海，拾得海底珊瑚来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠小南枝","author":"贝琼","text":"相逢彷佛在西湖，姑射仙人玉雪肤。\n春浅芳心浑木透，天寒翠柚不胜扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34695,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城南绝句 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"祗树园荒客不来，金银犹指旧楼台。\n风林日落鸟争噪，雪岸春迟花未开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34696,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城南绝句 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"流水萦回一道斜，隔林鸡犬两三家。\n雪深药坞迷行径，潮落村船阁浅沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34697,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城南绝句 其三","author":"贝琼","text":"已从春草长闲门，风雨连朝不出村。\n老妇煎茶烧上锉，故人送酒涤山樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34698,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"二月杨溪花乱开，黄须紫萼斩新裁。\n春到清明已如客，看花一日定千回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34699,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"出门今日向何处，花恼山翁走欲狂。\n此身忽已过半百，直须烂醉荅春光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34700,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日 其三","author":"贝琼","text":"北里南邻日日过，花开不饮竟如何。\n庭前昨夜暂相赏，地上今朝应更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34701,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯棘双禽","author":"贝琼","text":"山禽白头如老翁，一双相命复相从。\n秋田无禾苦不饱，下上胡为荆棘中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34702,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中见梅","author":"贝琼","text":"乌龙井上杓销雪，白鹤山中又见春。\n须可百回来绕树，莫教一片落随人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34703,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东村漫兴 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"溪上秋风老拒霜，居人星散似淮乡。\n谁家十五琵琶女，就客能弹陌上桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34704,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东村漫兴 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"八月雨多新水生，村南村北断车声。\n老夫不识市朝变，但与野人歌太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34705,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春后五日","author":"贝琼","text":"北风夜吹碧海冻，立春以来仍苦寒。\n城南酒贵更须买，江上花迟谁与看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34706,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵邵筼谷暮春三首 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"一枕槐根午梦长，不知梦里别春光。\n禽工唱和偏能熟，蜂苦经营也自忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34707,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵邵筼谷暮春三首 其三","author":"贝琼","text":"樱颗红垂山雨晴，荷钱绿卷水风生。\n佳人莫惜频行斝，狂客从教醉绝缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34708,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题红梅","author":"贝琼","text":"山杏一株临大路，宫桃千叶倚空墙。\n如何冰雪罗浮女，也学春风半面妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34709,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"今朝无酒只清坐，落笔犹有气淩云。\n天下黄金贱如土，何人为购相如文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34710,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"东邻昨日收白骨，西邻今日啼青蛾。\n伤心又过中元节，城下招魂应更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34711,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其三","author":"贝琼","text":"平生落落苦难合，十五读书今老翁。\n却怕秋来添客思，梧桐昨夜又西风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34712,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其四","author":"贝琼","text":"南金大贝亦何物，六月胡商死道边。\n满地清阴日亭午，老夫高枕北窗眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34713,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤城吕徽之博闻强识宋亡遂晦不仕一日大雪中至巨家易谷立堂下久之堂东偏众客方咏雪有分韵得蝶字者艾思不就徽之不觉失笑咸诘之曰汝何笑曰吾欲用滕王蛱蝶事耳众客皆惊阴知其为徽之也延之坐不可欲赒以谷辞既去使人尾之至其居地极幽阻及雪霁候焉荆扉竹屋不蔽风雨见桶中坐一妇人盖其妻也问徽之所在曰出捕鱼矣得于溪上具言所以来之意曰诸子可少留乃换酒共饮返宿道傍大楼下主人怪舆马之盛因言其状主人亦不知有徽之也明日求之则已迁居矣徽之","author":"贝琼","text":"空山积雪深一尺，车马何来野老疑。\n溪上捕鱼归换酒，更无人识吕徽之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34714,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别徐楚芳","author":"贝琼","text":"别愁如佛割人肠，空洒西风泪万行。\n楚尾吴头各千里，相知从此不相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34715,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪云林小景","author":"贝琼","text":"云林笔力如王宰，剪断吴淞水半江。\n更须著我扁舟坐，闲看飞来白鸟双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34716,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻筝","author":"贝琼","text":"白发潘郎工锦筝，江南江北尽知名。\n双手重弹白翎雀，犹是黄龙塞下声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34717,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巳酉重午","author":"贝琼","text":"风雨端阳生晦冥，汨罗无处吊英灵。\n海榴花发应相笑，无酒渊明也独醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34718,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归东郊偶成 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"爱酒狂生老未逢，十年踪迹滞吴淞。\n归来乡党都非旧，不及青山向我浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34719,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归东郊偶成 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"海上逃生万死馀，乱兵初定且安居。\n封侯万里须弓马，错教儿童尽读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294