58ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月廿五日夜口号","author":"贝琼","text":"破月五更飞上天，北林鸟啼惊客眠。\n劳生扰扰亦何事，溪女溪童相荡船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34727,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥重午","author":"贝琼","text":"去年重午忆嘉兴，风雨龙河一病僧。\n今日山中人重午，故人持酒说金陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34728,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥七夕五首 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"子晋吹笙学凤皇，缑山一别已千霜。\n当时黄屋非无意，岂有神仙到帝王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34729,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥七夕五首 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"阿母西来降汉家，刚风万里送飞车。\n空留千岁蟠桃核，白发到郎不见花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34730,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥七夕五首 其四","author":"贝琼","text":"东家西家争曝衣，我但曝书誇小儿。\n壁中科斗古文字，犹有射光天陆离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34731,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛亥七夕五首 其五","author":"贝琼","text":"性拙如鸠本自偏，柳州何必更祈天。\n人间机巧知多少，无复三皇五帝前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34732,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澄林冬日","author":"贝琼","text":"连村桑柘犹存叶，一树枇杷已著花。\n十月澄林好风景，恰如秋浦野人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34733,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"贝琼","text":"一南一北鸟辞亩，一东一西芯送人。\n与君此别似送鸟，对酒那不惜青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34734,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读书所有白花一株状类杨州琼花而花损一叶俗称为八仙云为赋一绝且悼璚花之不复见而独见此也","author":"贝琼","text":"一夜东风吹白雪，化为胡蝶过西家。\n七香车远人何处，空认唐昌观里花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34735,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月廿九日过永昌寺访照觉原","author":"贝琼","text":"幽湖水落夜初冰，湖上云山翠百层。\n一个小舟轻似叶，西寻玛瑙寺中僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34736,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春情","author":"贝琼","text":"新来不画远山眉，翠被春寒起更迟。\n灵鹊定知人有喜，一双飞上万年枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34737,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝","author":"贝琼","text":"闻郎北过李陵台，湖上荷花今又开。\n那似鄂王填上树，枝枝叶叶尽南回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34738,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松下丈人图二绝 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"长和百岁走苍蛟，日夜松声如凤匏。\n山人有约赋归去，我亦来借白云巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34739,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松下丈人图二绝 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"仙人手曳九节杖，行看好山应未穷。\n石间三秀食可饱，一曲试和商颜翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34740,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇","author":"贝琼","text":"冰纨一尺写修竹，瑟瑟清风生夏寒。\n不见江南铁钩锁，总成石上青琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34741,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题红梅二首 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"红罗亭下又春风，小凤飞来树已空。\n后主当时欢宴处，新花如火照唐宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34742,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题红梅二首 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"野桥山店记年时，管领春风有一枝。\n却笑罗虬不解事，百篇空赋比红诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34743,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋","author":"贝琼","text":"白发新来不满梳，玉萧金管总成疏。\n梧桐院落秋风早，一夜神清喜读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34744,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题溪山春晓图","author":"贝琼","text":"仙家鸡犬白云中，水复山回路不通。\n万树桃花春似海，莫教重误打鱼翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34745,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山家","author":"贝琼","text":"锄豆南山八十翁，相逢相语夕阳中。\n门前一个冬青树，不学桃花似酒红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34746,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马文璧画二首 其一","author":"贝琼","text":"长忆秦溪马文璧，能诗能画最风流。\n酒酣落笔皆天趣，剪断巴江万里秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34747,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马文璧画二首 其二","author":"贝琼","text":"田家一簇江南路，草阁柴扉近水开。\n人背夕阳巫峡去，雁将秋色洞庭来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34748,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题凌波仙","author":"贝琼","text":"姮娥窃药能奔月，嬴女吹箫亦上天。\n万古阿甄魂魄苦，江清雪冷夜如年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34749,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送成德琦兄北归","author":"贝琼","text":"云中归雁总成行，肠断连枝尚异方。\n春满江南江北路，柳丝不似别愁长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34750,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"贝琼","text":"雪后寻梅恐未真，花光一日写花神。\n广寒玉兔分秋颖，剪断罗浮万树春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34751,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿王继远白云半间","author":"贝琼","text":"吴歌但少玉童双，且尽仙家酒百缸。\n一枕梅花清梦远，不知夜卧白云窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34752,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐雪州墨菊","author":"贝琼","text":"先生爱菊似柴桑，三径归来亦未荒。\n莫道空山秋色淡，新花一朵御袍黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34753,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题双陆士女","author":"贝琼","text":"手转枭卢为破颜，玉人何意整云鬟。\n也应暗卜关山客，归马须看一掷间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34754,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题虞鲁瞻山水","author":"贝琼","text":"御史新来水石工，数峰依约米南宫。\n试添茅屋秋林下，著我江南鹤发翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34755,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题东坡戴笠图","author":"贝琼","text":"两屐新泥蒻笠攲，满村风雨独归时。\n玉堂天上神仙客，妇女儿童总未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34756,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱实送桂花","author":"贝琼","text":"广寒宫里桫椤树，金粟初分第一枝。\n满室天香吹不断，老夫清夜酒醒时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34757,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹间桃花","author":"贝琼","text":"万琅玕里一枝春，向客无言又似颦。\n彷佛武陵溪上路，放舟何处觅秦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34758,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴县朱良性","author":"海瑞","text":"批鳞玉阙丈夫奇，正是风雷示变时。\n万死一生千古事，孤忠独立寸心知。\n神飞琼海乾坤老，泪满江南草木悲。\n幸有圣明公道在，会看殊典敕名祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34759,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏州府吴县朱良知 其一","author":"海瑞","text":"批鳞直夺比干志，苦节还同孤竹清。\n龙隐海天云万里，鹤归华表月三更。\n萧条棺外无馀物，冷落灵前有菜羹。\n说与傍人浑不信，山人亲见泪如倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":34760,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]